格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Atlas Cloud skills for Claude Code, Codex & Gemini CLI — generate images/videos and call 300+ AI models from your coding agent.","id":"gh:1175716983","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"atlas-cloud-skills","slug":"AtlasCloudAI/atlas-cloud-skills","topics":["agent-skills","ai","atlascloud","claude-code","dsh-plugin","generative-ai","image-generation","llm","mcp","video-generation"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Atlas Cloud skills for Claude Code, Codex & Gemini CLI — generate images/videos and call 300+ AI mod"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"els from your coding agent."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Atlas Cloud Skills"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> 🎬 **Seedance 2.5 is now live on Atlas Cloud!** ByteDance's newest flagship video model — native au"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"dio-video joint generation, up to **30s in a single generation**, native 480p/720p/1080p (up to 4K v"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"ia built-in super-resolution), aspect ratios from 21:9 to 9:16, and multimodal reference of up to 30"},{"id":"p3s4","text":" images + 10 videos + 10 audio clips. Available now: Text-to-Video · Image-to-Video · Reference-to-V"},{"id":"p3s5","text":"ideo from **$0.134/s**. Cheaper tiers: Seedance 2.0 Fast from **$0.072/s** · Seedance 2.0 Mini from "},{"id":"p3s6","text":"**$0.039/s**.\n>\n> 🔓 **Need the full-power build?** The **unrestricted / full-capability pipeline** —"},{"id":"p3s7","text":" fewer guardrails, broader subject range, max-fidelity output — is available through Atlas Cloud Wor"},{"id":"p3s8","text":"kflow. Hook it straight into your skill via the same API key.\n>\n> 🎬 **Newest video generations — Kli"},{"id":"p3s9","text":"ng 4.0 · Wan 3.0.** The latest Kling and Wan alongside Kling 3.0 / Video O3 and Wan 2.7 — same API k"},{"id":"p3s10","text":"ey, same endpoints, browse the full video line-up."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Use Atlas Cloud's 300+ image / video / LLM models inside Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, and other A"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"I coding agents. Generate images, videos & chat via curated Skills."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> **→ Get your free Atlas Cloud API key** — 300+ models, one key, OpenAI-compatible."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Supported Models"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- 🎬 **Video** (223) — Seedance 2.5 · MiniMax H3 Max · MiniMax H3 Fast · Gemini Omni 1.1 Flash · Mini"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"Max H3 · Wan-3.0-Prime\n- 🎨 **Image** (145) — GPT Image 2.6 Sunburst · GPT Image 2.6 Flare · GPT Imag"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"e 2.5 Sunburst · GPT Image 2.5 Flare\n- 🧊 **3D** (14) — Seed3D 2.0 · Tripo H3.1 · Hunyuan 3D Rapid · "},{"id":"p7s4","text":"Hunyuan 3D Pro\n- 💬 **LLM** (83) — Hy4 · DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 1017 · Kimi K3.1 Pro HighSpeed · Kimi K3"},{"id":"p7s5","text":".1 Pro\n- 🔊 **Audio (TTS · Music · ASR)** (19) — Seed Audio 1.0 · MiniMax Speech 2.6 Turbo · MiniMax "},{"id":"p7s6","text":"Speech 2.6 HD · xAI TTS v1"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- 📚 **Explore more** — all 517 live models »"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Contents"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- Supported Models\n- Featured Recipes\n- Available Skills\n- atlas-cloud\n- seedance-2-5-skill\n- univer"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"sal-video-prompt-skill\n- Installation\n- Setup\n- What You Can Do\n- MCP Server\n- More Atlas Cloud Tool"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"al-video-prompt-skill\n- Installation\n- Setup\n- What You Can Do\n- MCP Server\n- More Atlas Cloud Tools"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Featured Recipes"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Don't start from a blank prompt — start from a workflow. Three to try first:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- 🛍️ **Product Render → 30-Second Ad** — turn a product still into a short ad clip\n- 🎭 **Character S"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"heet → Multi-Shot AI Drama** — one character, consistent across shots\n- 📱 **Long Video → Vertical Sh"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"ort** — reframe + animate for TikTok / Reels / Shorts"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**Browse all 25 recipes in the library »** — across 🎨 visual · 🎬 motion · ✂️ edit · 📱 social."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Available Skills"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### atlas-cloud"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Quickly integrate Atlas Cloud API into your projects. This skill provides:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- Complete API reference for image generation, video generation, LLM chat, media upload, and quick g"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"eneration\n- All 9 MCP tools documented: `atlas_list_models`, `atlas_search_docs`, `atlas_get_model_i"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"nfo`, `atlas_generate_image`, `atlas_generate_video`, `atlas_quick_generate`, `atlas_chat`, `atlas_g"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"et_prediction`, `atlas_upload_media`\n- Ready-to-use code templates in Python, Node.js/TypeScript, an"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"d cURL\n- Popular model IDs with pricing info\n- OpenAI SDK compatibility guide for LLM models\n- Error"},{"id":"p18s6","text":" handling, retry strategy, and best practices"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### seedance-2-5-skill"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"A model-specific sub-skill for controllable Seedance video, layered on top of `atlas-cloud`. Use it "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"when a job needs shot planning rather than a single prompt:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- **Route selection first** — text-to-video, storyboard-image-to-video, asset-reference-to-video, fi"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"rst-and-last-frame, or extending an existing clip\n- **Reference discipline** — how to assign people "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"/ product / scene / style / audio references so identity holds across shots\n- **Shot craft** — camer"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"a, lighting and composition vocabulary, transition patterns, long-video continuity, real-person hand"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"ling\n- **Editing and extension** — rewriting part of an existing video, changing lighting or style, "},{"id":"p21s6","text":"extending a short clip\n- **Execution** — submits through Atlas Cloud (MCP, CLI or REST) and verifies"},{"id":"p21s7","text":" model availability before a billable run\n- Every reference ships in English and Simplified Chinese;"},{"id":"p21s8","text":" Chinese requests follow a dedicated Chinese workflow"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Works with `universal-video-prompt-skill` when the same brief needs to run on more than one model. P"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"rompt library for this model: awesome-seedance-2.5-prompts-skills"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### universal-video-prompt-skill"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Model-agnostic companion to `seedance-2-5-skill`. It writes one prompt **spec** — scope, locks, stag"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ing, end states — separately from the dialect that expresses it, then compiles that spec for whichev"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"er video model you can actually call. Use it when:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- The same brief has to run on several models, or the target model is not available yet and the work"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" must proceed elsewhere\n- You are building a model-comparison matrix and need the prompts to differ "},{"id":"p25s3","text":"only by dialect\n- A prompt must survive a model swap instead of being rewritten"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Each model carries a measured profile (reference syntax, limits, timing adherence, default-bias beha"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"viour); the skill probes what it does not know, degrades the spec to what the model supports, and re"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"ports every degrade. English + Simplified Chinese references throughout."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### One-Line Install"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## What You Can Do"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Capability | Endpoint | Example Models |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| **Image Generation** | `POST /api/v1/model/generateImage` | Nano Banana 2, Seedream v5.0, Z-Image "},{"id":"p32s2","text":"|\n| **Video Generation** | `POST /api/v1/model/generateVideo` | Seedance 2.5, Kling 4.0, Wan 3.0, Kl"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"ing Video O3 |\n| **Audio — TTS & Music** | `POST /api/v1/model/generateAudio` | Seed Audio 1.0, Suno"},{"id":"p32s4","text":" Chirp v5, MiniMax Music |\n| **Speech-to-Text (ASR)** | `POST /api/v1/model/generateAudio` | Seed AS"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"R 2.0, xAI STT |\n| **3D Generation** | `POST /api/v1/model/generateImage` | Seed3D 2.0, Hunyuan 3D ("},{"id":"p32s6","text":"image/text-to-3D) |\n| **LLM Chat** | `POST /v1/chat/completions` | Qwen3.5, Kimi K2.5, DeepSeek V3.2"},{"id":"p32s7","text":", GLM 5 |\n| **Upload Media** | `POST /api/v1/model/uploadMedia` | Upload local files to get public U"},{"id":"p32s8","text":"RLs |\n| **Quick Generate** | Auto model search + submit | One-step generation by keyword |\n| **Searc"},{"id":"p32s9","text":"h Models** | Fuzzy search by keyword | Find models by name, type, or provider |"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
